body: "Delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1353\n\nThe current history/activity provenance projection fixture creates a real event under a native xhigh harness, then appends its intended xhigh legacy event. An effort-only filter correctly matches both, so the existing count=1 assertion depends on ambient host effort. The original pm-xgah3a foreign AI_AGENT resolver/sandbox correction remains shipped and unchanged. This recurrence has a different source: an uncontrolled negative-control creation event in another fixture.\n\nThe fix explicitly declares the native host challenge, reseals creation provenance as asserted low effort, retains both events, and verifies unfiltered count=2 plus the original filtered count=1 through real SDK/CLI paths. Full-source and canonical static validation are already recorded and remain unchanged by this ownership correction."
